Package: imessagebrowser
Title: Browse iMessage and SMS Backup Databases
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("minesweeper106", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "k8g7v7yfq8@privaterelay.appleid.com")
Description: A local 'shiny' app for browsing iMessage and SMS backup
    databases ('sms.db' from an iPhone backup or 'chat.db' from a Mac). Shows
    conversations in a chat-style view, supports contact names from an iPhone
    Address Book, keyword search across all chats, and export of a
    conversation as a single self-contained HTML file. Everything runs
    locally.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/minesweeper106/ShinyR-iMessageBrowser
BugReports: https://github.com/minesweeper106/ShinyR-iMessageBrowser/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports:
    DBI,
    htmltools,
    RSQLite,
    shiny,
    shinydashboard,
    shinydashboardPlus,
    utils,
    DT
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
